ruction jobs such as [estimating](/jobs-in-construction/estimating), [health & safety](/jobs-in-construction/health-safety-environment) and [contract administration](/jobs-in-construction/contracts-management) positions. Search for [foreperson or supervisor](/jobs-in-construction/foreperson-supervisors) employment or a career in [construction project management](/jobs-in-construction/project-management)."},{path:/^\/jobs-in-consulting-strategy\/?$/,blurb:"Find consulting & strategy jobs such as [corporate development](/jobs-in-consulting-strategy/corporate-development) and [management consulting](/jobs-in-consulting-strategy/management-change-consulting) positions. Search for employment in [policy](/jobs-in-consulting-strategy/policy) or [analyst](/jobs-in-consulting-strategy/analysts) roles."},{path:/^\/jobs-in-call-centre-customer-service\/?$/,blurb:"Find call centre & customer service jobs such as [call centre](/jobs-in-call-centre-customer-service/customer-service-call-centre), [supervisors/team leaders](/jobs-in-call-centre-customer-service/supervisors-team-leaders) and [management](/jobs-in-call-centre-customer-service/management-support) positions. Search for [inbound](/jobs-in-call-centre-customer-service/sales-inbound) and [outbound](/jobs-in-call-centre-customer-service/sales-outbound) sales employment."},{path:/^\/jobs-in-design-architecture\/?$/,blurb:"Find design & architecture jobs such as [architectural drafting](/jobs-in-design-architecture/architectural-drafting), [fashion design](/jobs-in-design-architecture/fashion-textile-design), [illustration](/jobs-in-design-architecture/illustration-animation), [graphic design](/jobs-in-design-architecture/graphic-design), [industrial design](/jobs-in-design-architecture/industrial-design) and [web & interaction design](/jobs-in-design-architecture/web-interaction-design)."},{path:/^\/jobs-in-education-training\/?$/,blurb:"Find education & training jobs such as [primary school teacher](/jobs-in-education-training/teaching-primary), [high school teacher](/jobs-in-education-training/teaching-secondary), [lecturer](/jobs-in-education-training/teaching-tertiary), and [teaching aide](/jobs-in-education-training/teaching-aides-special-needs) positions. Search for [tutoring](/jobs-in-education-training/tutoring) employment or a career in [student services](/jobs-in-education-training/student-services)."},{path:/^\/jobs-in-engineering\/?$/,blurb:"Find engineering jobs such as [civil & structural](/jobs-in-engineering/civil-structural-engineering), [aerospace](/jobs-in-engineering/aerospace-engineering), [mechanical](/jobs-in-engineering/mechanical-engineering) and [electrical](/jobs-in-engineering/electrical-electronic-engineering) engineering positions. Search for [drafting](/jobs-in-engineering/engineering-drafting) employment or a career in [engineering project management](/jobs-in-engineering/project-management)."},{path:/^\/jobs-in-farming-animals-conservation\/?$/,blurb:"Find farming, animals & conservation jobs such as [fishing](/jobs-in-farming-animals-conservation/fishing-aquaculture) and [veterinary science](/jobs-in-farming-animals-conservation/veterinary-services-animal-welfare) positions. Search for employment in [horticulture](/jobs-in-farming-animals-conservation/horticulture) or a career in [viticulture](/jobs-in-farming-animals-conservation/winery-viticulture)."},{country:"NZ",path:/^\/jobs-in-government-defence\/?$/,blurb:"Find New Zealand government jobs for [government](/jobs-in-government-defence/government), [local](/jobs-in-government-defence/local-government) government and [regional council](/jobs-in-government-defence/regional-council) positions. Search for public service employment as a [policy advisor or policy analyst](/jobs-in-government-defence/policy-planning-regulation), or a career in the [army](/jobs-in-government-defence/army), [navy](/jobs-in-government-defence/navy), [air force](/jobs-in-government-defence/air-force), [prison system or poli